flowchart LR
    subgraph D["1 · Model decision"]
      direction TB
      I["User input + tool schemas"] --> L["LLM API"] --> C["function_call<br/>name · arguments · call_id"]
    end
    subgraph X["2 · Python execution"]
      direction TB
      R["Agent runtime<br/>validate + dispatch"] --> T["Python tool<br/>actually executes"] --> O["function_call_output<br/>same call_id + result"]
    end
    D -->|tool request| X
    X -->|tool result| N["3 · Next LLM API call<br/>answer or another tool request"]
